-- --- APPLE MACBOOKS (6 products) ---
('apple-macbook-air-m3-16gb-256gb', 'Apple MacBook Air M3 13.6" 16GB RAM 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 1450000, 1450000, 1180000, 12, 1.24, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-16gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Apple MacBook Air M3 redefines thin-and-light computing with the transformative M3 chip built on 3nm architecture. The stunning 13.6-inch Liquid Retina display with 2560x1664 resolution, P3 wide color, True Tone, and 500 nits brightness provides an expansive canvas for work and creativity. An 8-core CPU (4 performance, 4 efficiency) and up to 10-core GPU with hardware-accelerated ray tracing deliver up to 60% faster performance than M1 MacBook Air, powering through photo editing, 4K video, software development, and multitasking. The 16GB unified memory and 256GB SSD ensure fluid application switching. The fanless design remains completely silent. Features include 1080p FaceTime HD camera with computational video, three-mic array with voice isolation, six-speaker sound system with Spatial Audio and Dolby Atmos, MagSafe 3 charging, two Thunderbolt / USB 4 ports, and a 3.5mm headphone jack. Up to 18 hours of battery life enables all-day productivity. The thin 11.3mm aluminum unibody in Midnight, Starlight, Space Gray, and Silver weighs just 1.24kg. Apple Intelligence with macOS Sequoia, Touch ID, and seamless iPhone integration complete the ultimate portable laptop.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1180000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-16gb-256gb.jpg', 1298000, 4.9, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-macbook-air-m3-8gb-256gb', 'Apple MacBook Air M3 13.6" 8GB RAM 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 1250000, 1250000, 1020000, 18, 1.24, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The MacBook Air M3 with 8GB RAM delivers the same stunning 13.6-inch Liquid Retina display, M3 chip performance, and 18-hour battery life at a more accessible price. Perfect for students, writers, and everyday productivity. The fanless design, MagSafe charging, 1080p camera, and premium aluminum unibody in four colors. macOS Sequoia with Apple Intelligence. The ideal entry into Mac computing.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1020000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-8gb-256gb.jpg', 1122000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-macbook-air-m3-15-16gb-512gb', 'Apple MacBook Air M3 15.3" 16GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 1750000, 1750000, 1430000, 10, 1.51, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-15-16gb-512gb.jpg', 'The 15.3-inch MacBook Air M3 provides the largest display ever in a MacBook Air with the same extraordinary thin-and-light design. The expansive 2880x1864 Liquid Retina display offers more room for multitasking, creative work, and entertainment. M3 chip with 16GB RAM and 512GB SSD, six-speaker sound system with force-cancelling woofers, 18-hour battery, and 1080p camera. At just 11.5mm thin and 1.51kg, it is the world''s best 15-inch laptop for those who want maximum screen real estate without sacrificing portability.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1430000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-air-m3-15-16gb-512gb.jpg', 1573000, 4.8, 1, 'Apple', 0, 1),

('apple-macbook-pro-m4-14-16gb-512gb', 'Apple MacBook Pro M4 14.2" 16GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 2450000, 2450000, 2000000, 8, 1.55, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-m4-14-16gb-512gb.jpg', 'The MacBook Pro M4 14-inch is the professional''s powerhouse. The M4 chip features a 10-core CPU, 10-core GPU, and 16-core Neural Engine delivering massive performance gains for coding, video editing, 3D rendering, and AI workflows. The breathtaking 14.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display with 3024x1964 resolution, 1600 nits peak brightness, 1,000,000:1 contrast ratio, and ProMotion 120Hz adaptive refresh rate provides reference-grade color (P3, True Tone). 16GB unified memory with 120GB/s bandwidth, 512GB super-fast SSD, and advanced thermal system with dual fans sustain peak performance. Features include HDMI 2.1 (8K 60Hz), SDXC card slot, MagSafe 3, three Thunderbolt 4 ports, 1080p camera, six-speaker high-fidelity sound system with Spatial Audio, studio-quality three-mic array, and up to 22 hours battery. macOS Sequoia with Apple Intelligence. The tool of choice for developers, designers, and content creators.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 2000000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-m4-14-16gb-512gb.jpg', 2200000, 4.9, 1, 'Apple', 1, 1),

('apple-macbook-pro-m4-16-24gb-1tb', 'Apple MacBook Pro M4 Pro 16.2" 24GB RAM 1TB SSD', 'laptops', 3800000, 3800000, 3100000, 5, 2.14, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-m4-16-24gb-1tb.jpg', 'The 16-inch MacBook Pro with M4 Pro chip is the ultimate mobile workstation. M4 Pro features up to 14-core CPU and 20-core GPU with 24GB unified memory and 1TB SSD. The expansive 16.2-inch Liquid Retina XDR display (3456x2234, 1600 nits HDR, ProMotion) provides unmatched screen real estate. Thunderbolt 5, HDMI 2.1 (8K 240Hz), Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 5.4. Up to 24 hours battery — the longest ever in a Mac. For professionals who demand uncompromising performance: film scoring, 3D animation, AI model training, and scientific computing.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 3100000, '/assets/products/apple-macbook-pro-m4-16-24gb-1tb.jpg', 3410000, 4.9, 0, 'Apple', 0, 1),

-- --- HP LAPTOPS (5 products) ---
('hp-15s-i5-12th-8gb-512gb', 'HP 15s 12th Gen Intel Core i5 8GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 850000, 850000, 695000, 15, 1.75, '/assets/products/hp-15s-i5-12th-8gb-512gb.jpg', 'The HP 15s is the quintessential everyday laptop powered by 12th Gen Intel Core i5-1235U processor (10 cores, up to 4.4GHz) with Intel Iris Xe graphics. The 15.6-inch FHD (1920x1080) anti-glare display with micro-edge bezel provides an 82% screen-to-body ratio for immersive viewing. 8GB DDR4 RAM and 512GB PCIe NVMe SSD deliver swift boot times and responsive multitasking. Features include HP True Vision 720p HD camera with temporal noise reduction, dual array digital microphones, dual speakers, Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, 1x USB-C, 2x USB-A, HDMI 1.4b, SD card reader, and 3.5mm audio jack. The full-size keyboard with numeric keypad is spill-resistant. Windows 11 Home, up to 7.5 hours battery, and HP Fast Charge (0-50% in 45 minutes). The sleek silver design weighs 1.75kg. Perfect for students, professionals, and home office productivity with HP''s trusted build quality and local service support in Nigeria.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 695000, '/assets/products/hp-15s-i5-12th-8gb-512gb.jpg', 764500, 4.5, 1, 'HP', 1, 0),

('hp-elitebook-840-g10-i5-16gb-512gb', 'HP EliteBook 840 G10 Intel Core i5 16GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 950000, 950000, 780000, 12, 1.4, '/assets/products/hp-elitebook-840-g10-i5-16gb-512gb.jpg', 'The HP EliteBook 840 G10 is a premium business laptop engineered for professionals who demand security, durability, and performance. 13th Gen Intel Core i5-1335U processor with 16GB DDR5 RAM and 512GB PCIe Gen4 SSD. The 14-inch WUXGA (1920x1200) IPS anti-glare display with 400 nits and 100% sRGB provides sharp, color-accurate visuals. Enterprise-grade security includes HP Wolf Security, HP Sure Start self-healing BIOS, fingerprint sensor, IR facial recognition, privacy camera shutter, and TPM 2.0. Military-grade MIL-STD-810H tested for durability. Features Wi-Fi 6E, Bluetooth 5.3, 2x Thunderbolt 4, 2x USB-A, HDMI 2.1, nano-SIM (4G/5G optional), and Smart Card reader. The spill-resistant backlit keyboard with HP Quiet Keyboard technology ensures comfortable, quiet typing. Windows 11 Pro, up to 13 hours battery, and fast charging. Weighing just 1.4kg with an aluminum chassis, it is the ideal business companion.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 780000, '/assets/products/hp-elitebook-840-g10-i5-16gb-512gb.jpg', 858000, 4.7, 1, 'HP', 1, 0),

('hp-pavilion-x360-14-i5-8gb-512gb', 'HP Pavilion x360 14" Intel Core i5 8GB RAM 512GB SSD 2-in-1', 'laptops', 720000, 720000, 588000, 14, 1.55, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-x360-14-i5-8gb-512gb.jpg', 'The HP Pavilion x360 14-inch convertible features a 360° hinge for laptop, tent, stand, and tablet modes. 12th Gen Intel Core i5-1235U, 8GB RAM, 512GB SSD. The 14-inch FHD IPS touchscreen with Corning Gorilla Glass NBT and HP Rechargeable MPP 2.0 Pen support enables natural drawing and note-taking. B&O dual speakers, HP Wide Vision 5MP camera with auto frame, Wi-Fi 6, USB-C, and Windows 11 Home. The flexible 2-in-1 for students and creative professionals.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 588000, '/assets/products/hp-pavilion-x360-14-i5-8gb-512gb.jpg', 646800, 4.5, 0, 'HP', 0, 1),

