('dell-latitude-3420-i5-8gb-256gb', 'Dell Latitude 3420 Intel Core i5 8GB RAM 256GB SSD', 'laptops', 650000, 650000, 530000, 18, 1.6, '/assets/products/dell-latitude-3420-i5-8gb-256gb.jpg', 'The Dell Latitude 3420 is a business-grade 14-inch laptop built for reliability and security. 11th Gen Intel Core i5-1135G7 processor, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and 256GB NVMe SSD. 14-inch FHD anti-glare display, spill-resistant keyboard, and comprehensive ports including USB-C with Power Delivery, USB-A 3.2 (x2), HDMI, RJ-45 Ethernet, and microSD reader. Dell Optimizer AI learns usage patterns for faster app launches and better battery. TPM 2.0, wedge lock slot, and durable design. Windows 11 Pro with Dell support. The trusted choice for enterprise, government, and education sectors.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 530000, '/assets/products/dell-latitude-3420-i5-8gb-256gb.jpg', 583000, 4.6, 0, 'Dell', 0, 0),

('dell-inspiron-15-i7-16gb-1tb', 'Dell Inspiron 15 Intel Core i7 16GB RAM 1TB SSD', 'laptops', 1100000, 1100000, 900000, 8, 1.75, '/assets/products/dell-inspiron-15-i7-16gb-1tb.jpg', 'The Dell Inspiron 15 is a powerful all-rounder with 13th Gen Intel Core i7-1355U, 16GB DDR4 RAM, and 1TB PCIe SSD. 15.6-inch FHD anti-glare display with ComfortView Plus reduces blue light. Intel Iris Xe graphics, Waves MaxxAudio Pro-tuned stereo speakers, full-size keyboard with numeric keypad, and comprehensive ports. Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, USB-C with PD, USB-A, HDMI 1.4, SD card reader. Windows 11 Home, ExpressCharge (80% in 60 minutes). Ideal for multitasking, content creation, and entertainment.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 900000, '/assets/products/dell-inspiron-15-i7-16gb-1tb.jpg', 990000, 4.5, 0, 'Dell', 0, 1),

('dell-xps-13-plus-i7-16gb-512gb', 'Dell XPS 13 Plus Intel Core i7 16GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1500000, 6, 1.23, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13-plus-i7-16gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Dell XPS 13 Plus is a futuristic ultrabook with a seamless glass touchpad, capacitive touch function row, and virtually borderless 13.4-inch 3.5K OLED touch display. 13th Gen Intel Core i7-1360P, 16GB LPDDR5 RAM, 512GB SSD. CNC machined aluminum chassis, quad-speaker design, 720p IR camera, Windows Hello, Wi-Fi 6E. A design masterpiece that redefines premium Windows computing.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1500000, '/assets/products/dell-xps-13-plus-i7-16gb-512gb.jpg', 1650000, 4.7, 0, 'Dell', 0, 1),

