('lenovo-ideapad-3-i5-12th-8gb-512gb', 'Lenovo IdeaPad 3 Intel Core i5 12th Gen 8GB RAM 512GB SSD', 'laptops', 750000, 750000, 612000, 20, 1.65, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-3-i5-12th-8gb-512gb.jpg', 'The Lenovo IdeaPad 3 delivers exceptional value with 12th Gen Intel Core i5-1235U, 8GB DDR4 RAM, and 512GB PCIe SSD. The 15.6-inch FHD IPS display with anti-glare coating and narrow bezels on three sides provides an 87% active area ratio. Dolby Audio dual speakers, 720p HD webcam with privacy shutter, and Lenovo Smart Noise Cancelling for clear calls. Features Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.2, USB-C 3.2, 2x USB-A 3.2, HDMI 1.4b, SD card reader, and 3.5mm jack. The full-size keyboard with numeric keypad offers 1.5mm key travel for comfortable typing. Windows 11 Home, up to 8 hours battery with Rapid Charge (2 hours in 15 minutes). Ergonomic design, lightweight 1.65kg, and Lenovo''s legendary build quality. The smart choice for students, families, and home office productivity.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 612000, '/assets/products/lenovo-ideapad-3-i5-12th-8gb-512gb.jpg', 673200, 4.4, 0, 'Lenovo', 1, 1),

