('lenovo-legion-5-i7-16gb-1tb-rtx4060', 'Lenovo Legion 5 Intel Core i7 16GB RAM 1TB SSD RTX 4060', 'laptops', 1850000, 1850000, 1500000, 8, 2.4, '/assets/products/lenovo-legion-5-i7-16gb-1tb-rtx4060.jpg', 'The Lenovo Legion 5 is a serious gaming and creative laptop. 13th Gen Intel Core i7-13700H, 16GB DDR5 RAM, 1TB PCIe Gen4 SSD, and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB with 140W TGP. 15.6-inch WQHD (2560x1440) IPS display with 165Hz refresh, 3ms response, 100% sRGB, and NVIDIA G-SYNC. Legion ColdFront 5.0 with dual fans, quad exhaust, and copper heat pipes. TrueStrike keyboard with 4-zone RGB, Nahimic 3D audio, Wi-Fi 6E, 80Wh battery with Super Rapid Charge. For gamers and creators seeking desktop-class performance.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 1500000, '/assets/products/lenovo-legion-5-i7-16gb-1tb-rtx4060.jpg', 1650000, 4.7, 0, 'Lenovo', 0, 1),

