-- --- JBL AUDIO (8 products) ---
('jbl-tune-beam-2', 'JBL Tune Beam 2 ANC True Wireless Earbuds', 'audio', 65000, 65000, 53000, 60, 0.052, '/assets/products/jbl-tune-beam-2.jpg', 'The JBL Tune Beam 2 elevates the best-selling Tune series with Active Noise Cancellation and Smart Ambient technology. 10mm dynamic drivers with JBL Pure Bass Sound deliver deep, punchy low-end that makes every genre come alive. Bluetooth 5.4 with LE Audio and Auracast, quad-mic array with AI ENC for crystal-clear calls, and Personi-Fi 3.0 hearing test customization. 48-hour total battery (12 hours earbuds + 36 hours case with ANC off, 10+30 with ANC on). IP54 water and dust resistance, Google Fast Pair, Microsoft Swift Pair, and multi-point connection. JBL Headphones app with customizable EQ, Find My Buds, and VoiceAware. The ergonomic closed stick design with oval tubes and three ear tip sizes ensures a secure, comfortable fit. Available in Black, White, Blue, and Purple. A significant upgrade for JBL fans seeking premium features at a mid-range price.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/jbl-tune-beam-2.jpg', 58300, 4.6, 0, 'JBL', 0, 1),

('jbl-tune-flex-2', 'JBL Tune Flex 2 ANC True Wireless Earbuds', 'audio', 75000, 75000, 61200, 50, 0.054, '/assets/products/jbl-tune-flex-2.jpg', 'JBL Tune Flex 2 are versatile open-ear earbuds with ANC and JBL Pure Bass Sound via 12mm drivers. Bluetooth 5.4, adaptive ANC, ambient aware, and talk-thru modes. 40-hour total battery, IP54, wireless charging case, and Personi-Fi 3.0. The semi-open design provides all-day comfort without ear tip fatigue. Ideal for office, commuting, and calls.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 61200, '/assets/products/jbl-tune-flex-2.jpg', 67320, 4.5, 0, 'JBL', 0, 1),

('jbl-quantum-tws-gaming', 'JBL Quantum TWS Gaming True Wireless Earbuds', 'audio', 85000, 85000, 69500, 40, 0.06, '/assets/products/jbl-quantum-tws-gaming.jpg', 'JBL Quantum TWS are purpose-built for gaming with a 2.4GHz USB-C dongle delivering ultra-low 35ms latency and Bluetooth 5.3 for mobile. JBL QuantumSURROUND for spatial audio, 11mm drivers, and dual-mic with noise suppression. 24-hour battery (8+16), IPX4, and customizable JBL QuantumENGINE PC software. The ultimate wireless gaming earbuds for PC, console, and mobile.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69500, '/assets/products/jbl-quantum-tws-gaming.jpg', 76450, 4.5, 0, 'JBL', 0, 0),

('jbl-go-4-portable-speaker', 'JBL Go 4 Portable Bluetooth Speaker', 'audio', 28000, 28000, 22800, 70, 0.19, '/assets/products/jbl-go-4-portable-speaker.jpg', 'The JBL Go 4 is the ultra-compact portable speaker that packs serious JBL Pro Sound with punchy bass in a design that fits in your palm. IP67 waterproof and dustproof rating means it can be submerged and rinsed off. Bluetooth 5.4 with Auracast, built-in strap with carabiner loop, and up to 7 hours of playtime on a single charge. USB-C charging, speakerphone function, and JBL Portable app with customizable EQ and stereo pairing. Available in multiple vibrant colors including Squad, Black, Blue, Red, Purple, and White. The ultimate take-anywhere speaker for beach days, hiking, cycling, showers, and spontaneous gatherings. Weighing just 210g, the Go 4 proves that great things come in small packages.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 22800, '/assets/products/jbl-go-4-portable-speaker.jpg', 25080, 4.7, 1, 'JBL', 1, 1),

('jbl-flip-7', 'JBL Flip 7 Portable Bluetooth Speaker', 'audio', 65000, 65000, 53000, 45, 0.55, '/assets/products/jbl-flip-7.jpg', 'The JBL Flip 7 delivers bold JBL Original Pro Sound with an optimized racetrack-shaped driver and dual passive radiators for room-filling audio. IP68 waterproof and dustproof — fully submersible. Bluetooth 5.4 with Auracast, up to 16 hours battery, and USB-C charging with built-in power bank function. PartyBoost for linking multiple JBL speakers, built-in microphone, and rugged fabric design. The definitive portable speaker for outdoor adventures, pool parties, and travel.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 53000, '/assets/products/jbl-flip-7.jpg', 58300, 4.7, 1, 'JBL', 1, 1),

('jbl-charge-6', 'JBL Charge 6 Portable Bluetooth Speaker with Powerbank', 'audio', 120000, 120000, 98000, 30, 0.96, '/assets/products/jbl-charge-6.jpg', 'The JBL Charge 6 is the legendary portable speaker with built-in 20,000mAh power bank. JBL Original Pro Sound with an upgraded woofer, dual tweeters, and dual passive radiators. IP68 waterproof and dustproof, Bluetooth 5.4 with Auracast, 24 hours playtime, and USB-C fast charging. Multi-speaker connection via Auracast, built-in microphone, and rugged design. The ultimate party speaker that also charges your devices.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 98000, '/assets/products/jbl-charge-6.jpg', 107800, 4.8, 0, 'JBL', 1, 0),

('jbl-clip-5', 'JBL Clip 5 Portable Bluetooth Speaker', 'audio', 35000, 35000, 28500, 55, 0.22, '/assets/products/jbl-clip-5.jpg', 'The JBL Clip 5 features an integrated carabiner that clips onto bags, belts, and bike handlebars. JBL Pro Sound, IP68 rating, Bluetooth 5.4 with Auracast, 12 hours playtime, and USB-C. The redesigned wider carabiner opens fully for easy attachment. Ultra-portable at 230g. The ultimate companion for hiking, cycling, and outdoor adventures.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 28500, '/assets/products/jbl-clip-5.jpg', 31350, 4.6, 0, 'JBL', 0, 1),

-- --- SONY AUDIO (6 products) ---
('sony-wh-1000xm6', 'Sony WH-1000XM6 Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones', 'audio', 420000, 420000, 345000, 15, 0.25, '/assets/products/sony-wh-1000xm6.jpg', 'The Sony WH-1000XM6 is the pinnacle of wireless headphone technology, setting a new industry standard. The Integrated Processor V2 and QN2e HD Noise Cancelling processor eliminate more ambient noise than ever before, from airplane engine rumble to office chatter. Newly developed 40mm drivers with carbon fiber composite dome and soft-edge diaphragm reproduce frequencies up to 40kHz with breathtaking clarity, while DSEE Extreme upscales compressed audio to near-high-resolution quality. 360 Reality Audio with head tracking creates an immersive spatial soundstage. Multipoint connection, speak-to-chat auto-pause, adaptive sound control based on location and activity, and wear detection. 40-hour battery with ANC (45 hours without), quick charging (3 minutes = 3 hours), and premium lightweight design at 250g with plush synthetic leather ear cushions. USB-C audio and charging, 3.5mm jack, and included airplane adapter and carrying case. Available in Black, Silver, and Midnight Blue. The definitive premium headphone for frequent flyers, audiophiles, and discerning professionals.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 345000, '/assets/products/sony-wh-1000xm6.jpg', 379500, 4.9, 1, 'Sony', 1, 1),

('sony-wh-ch720n', 'Sony WH-CH720N Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones', 'audio', 85000, 85000, 69500, 40, 0.25, '/assets/products/sony-wh-ch720n.jpg', 'The Sony WH-CH720N brings Sony''s legendary noise cancellation to an accessible price point. Dual Noise Sensor technology and the Integrated Processor V1 deliver adjustable ANC for any environment. 30mm drivers with DSEE upscaling produce rich, detailed audio with powerful bass. The lightweight 192g design with comfortable oval earpads enables all-day wear. 35-hour battery with ANC (50 hours without), multipoint Bluetooth 5.3 connection, and Sony Headphones Connect app with EQ customization. Crystal-clear hands-free calling with Precise Voice Pickup technology and wind noise reduction. USB-C quick charging (3 minutes = 1 hour), 3.5mm jack, and swivel foldable design. An outstanding value for those wanting premium Sony ANC without the flagship price.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 69500, '/assets/products/sony-wh-ch720n.jpg', 76450, 4.7, 1, 'Sony', 1, 0),

('sony-wf-1000xm6', 'Sony WF-1000XM6 True Wireless Noise Cancelling Earbuds', 'audio', 320000, 320000, 262000, 20, 0.058, '/assets/products/sony-wf-1000xm6.jpg', 'Sony WF-1000XM6 are the world''s most advanced true wireless earbuds with the new Integrated Processor V3 and QN3e ANC chip delivering unprecedented noise cancellation in a compact form. 8.4mm Dynamic Driver X with neodymium magnets produces studio-quality sound with LDAC, DSEE Extreme, and 360 Reality Audio with head tracking. Speak-to-Chat, adaptive sound control, multipoint, 10 hours ANC playback (36 hours with case), wireless charging, IPX4, and bone conduction sensor for crystal-clear calls. The premium flagship earbuds.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 262000, '/assets/products/sony-wf-1000xm6.jpg', 288200, 4.8, 0, 'Sony', 0, 1),

('sony-ult-wear', 'Sony ULT Wear Wireless Headphones with ULT Power Sound', 'audio', 150000, 150000, 122000, 30, 0.26, '/assets/products/sony-ult-wear.jpg', 'Sony ULT Wear headphones are built for bass lovers with dedicated ULT button that activates ULT1 (deep bass) and ULT2 (powerful, energetic bass) modes. Integrated Processor V1 for ANC, 40mm drivers, 30-hour battery (50 hours ANC off), multipoint, and Sony Headphones Connect app. The bold, stylish design targets music fans who crave powerful, club-like sound.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 122000, '/assets/products/sony-ult-wear.jpg', 134200, 4.6, 0, 'Sony', 0, 0),

('sony-srs-xb100', 'Sony SRS-XB100 Portable Bluetooth Speaker', 'audio', 32000, 32000, 25800, 50, 0.26, '/assets/products/sony-srs-xb100.jpg', 'The Sony SRS-XB100 is a tiny yet powerful portable speaker with a full-range mono driver and passive radiator delivering clear, punchy sound with deep bass. IP67 waterproof and dustproof, Bluetooth 5.3, 16-hour battery, USB-C, and built-in microphone with echo cancelling. The detachable strap and compact 238g design attach to bags and belts. Available in Black, Blue, Orange, and Light Gray. Sony quality in an ultra-portable package.', 1, 1718400000, 1, 25800, '/assets/products/sony-srs-xb100.jpg', 28380, 4.5, 0, 'Sony', 0, 0),

